# ============================================================
# COMPRSLY, settings map (committed, names only, never values).
# Copy to .env in this folder for the project wide settings, and
# website/backend/.env.example to website/backend/.env for the website server's secrets.
# Every .env file stays on your laptop; git ignores them.
# ============================================================

# --- Desktop app (product/)
# Needs no settings and no API key. Spelling, grammar and prompt shrinking all
# run on the user's PC; the small model downloads once from Hugging Face.

# --- Website server (website/backend/.env, read by Wrangler when running locally)
# MSSTORE_TENANT_ID, MSSTORE_CLIENT_ID, MSSTORE_CLIENT_SECRET   Microsoft Store stats login
# RESEND_API_KEY                                                emails from the site
# STATS_KEY, STATS_PASSWORD                                     private stats page
# Database: Cloudflare D1 comprsly-analytics (set in backend/wrangler.jsonc, no password)
# Local run: cd website/backend, npx wrangler dev, http://localhost:8787

# --- Claude chats that work on this project (ids, not secrets)
CLAUDE_SESSION_COMPRSLY_DEV=
CLAUDE_CLOUD_CHAT_COMPRSLY=
